OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine and dry
OL,6,Fthis evening. It will be a rather
OL,7,Fmuggy night for many, with most places
OL,8,Fremaining dry overnight. However, a
OL,9,Ffew isolated spots of rain cannot be
OL,10,Fruled out after midnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAny early sunshine will
OL,13,Fgradually give way to increasing cloud
OL,14,Ffrom the west, bringing a slight
OL,15,Fchance of an afternoon shower. Still
OL,16,Fwarm in Suffolk and Essex. A dry
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
