OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Tuesday. Windy
OL,7,Fwith blustery showers on Wednesday,
OL,8,Fespecially in Norfolk. Dry with light
OL,9,Fwinds and hazy sunshine on Thursday.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,11,FSeptember.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
